# PDF Chatbot

Ask questions about any PDF document using Groq - llama-3.3-70b-versatile model as the AI backbone.

## Stack

- Backend: FastAPI, LangChain, sentence-transformers, FAISS, Groq API
- Frontend: Plain HTML/CSS/JS

## Setup

1. Clone the repo and create a virtual environment:
   python -m venv venv
   source venv/bin/activate

2. Install dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

3. Add your GROQ API key:
   Create a .env file in the project root:
   GROQ_API_KEY=your_key_here

4. Run the backend:
   uvicorn backend.main:app --reload

5. Serve the frontend:
   cd frontend && python -m http.server 5500

6. Open http://localhost:5500 in your browser.

## Usage

- Upload any PDF using the drag-and-drop zone
- Ask questions in the chat input
- Click "Show sources" under any answer to see the document excerpts used
- Click "Upload new PDF" to start over with a different document

## Limitations

- Scanned / image-only PDFs are not supported (no OCR)
- Only one PDF indexed at a time (uploading a new one replaces the index)